<title>USA: Zeeland PS, Mich., won by Roney.</title>
<headline>Zeeland PS, Mich., won by Roney.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roney &amp; Co., said it won $7.590 million of Zeeland PS, Mich., 1997 general obligation school building and site bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.30 percent.</p>
</text>
